│  │       ├── base_panel.py            # MANDATORY base class for GUI panels  │
│  │       ├── math_panel.py            # LaTeX SymPy limits/derivatives panel │
│  │       ├── data_panel.py            # Pandas preview and Plotly engine     │
│  │       ├── code_panel.py            # Interactive Jupyter Qt Console       │
│  │       ├── threed_panel.py          # VTK 3D engine canvas                 │
