│  [CRITICAL PATH RULE]                                                        │
│  The live filesystem squashfs must always be placed in `iso/build/casper/`,  │
│  never `iso/build/live/`. Casper expects this layout; using `live/` will     │
│  result in a kernel panic / boot failure.                                    │
│                                                                              │
