│  | 10| File Manager | desktop/filemanager.py | PySide6 | Phase 2 |           │
│  | 11| Login Screen | desktop/loginscreen.py | PySide6 | Phase 2 |           │
│  | 12| Desktop Shell Bar | desktop/shell/app.ts | Astal v2 TypeScript | Phase 2 | │
│  | 13| App Launcher | desktop/shell/widget/Launcher.ts | Astal v2 TS | Phase 2 | │
│  | 14| Notifications | desktop/shell/widget/Notifications.ts | Astal v2 TS | Phase 2 | │
│  | 15| XenoSense Daemon | desktop/xenosense/xenosense.py | Python | Phase 2 | │
