└──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘

┌──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│ ── 9. XENOSENSE SOCKET PROTOCOL ───────────────────────────────────────────── │
├──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤
│                                                                              │
│  All XenoSense events are emitted as single-line JSON on Unix socket         │
│  `/tmp/xeno-sense.sock`. Every component subscribing to XenoSense must       │
│  handle these schemas and gracefully handle socket unavailability.           │
│                                                                              │
│  Protocol packet schemas:                                                    │
│  ```json                                                                     │
│  {"type": "gesture_detected", "gesture": "SWIPE_LEFT", "confidence": 0.92, "timestamp": 1234567890.123} │
│  {"type": "gesture_detected", "gesture": "SWIPE_RIGHT", "confidence": 0.88, "timestamp": 1234567890.456} │
│  {"type": "gesture_detected", "gesture": "FIST", "confidence": 0.95, "timestamp": 1234567890.789} │
│  {"type": "gesture_detected", "gesture": "OPEN_PALM", "confidence": 0.91, "timestamp": 1234567890.012} │
│  {"type": "face_detected", "person": "xeno", "confidence": 0.97, "timestamp": 1234567890.345} │
│  {"type": "face_absent", "duration_seconds": 32, "timestamp": 1234567890.678} │
│  {"type": "speech_command", "command": "open math", "full_transcript": "hey xeno open math", "timestamp": 1234567890.901} │
│  {"type": "speech_result", "text": "full transcription here", "timestamp": 1234567890.234} │
│  {"type": "sound_event", "sound_type": "clap", "energy": 0.87, "timestamp": 1234567890.567} │
│  ```                                                                         │
│                                                                              │
│  Gesture name enum: SWIPE_LEFT, SWIPE_RIGHT, SWIPE_UP, SWIPE_DOWN,           │
│  PINCH_OPEN, PINCH_CLOSE, FIST, OPEN_PALM, PEACE, POINT                      │
│                                                                              │
└──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘

