│  Whenever you modify, add, or test any file, open 'CHANGELOG.md' at the root  │
│  directory, append a horizontal rule followed by your detailed briefing using│
│  the template below. Do not modify previous entries in 'CHANGELOG.md'.       │
│                                                                              │
│  Work Briefing Template:                                                     │
│  ```markdown                                                                 │
│  ### [DATE TIME] - Session Briefing                                          │
│  - Primary Objective: briefly state the goal                                 │
│  - Changes Made:                                                             │
│    * [File Path]: detailed changes made                                      │
│  - Compilation Outcome: passed, warnings, or failed with reason              │
│  - Tested In: VirtualBox, Hyper-V, or bare metal ThinkPad T480               │
│  - Diagnostic Findings: system state, kernel modules, test status            │
